HMePkysJ https://t.co/NCW6vD8fev", "url": "https://x.com/CEOMedium/status/2117371485115261172"}, {"author_id": "1620010466", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:53:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117374573465522205"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 43, "start": 40, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 69, "start": 64, "tag": "Math"}], "urls": [{"description": "As AI remakes the field of math, some students say they feel like giving up.", "display_url": "ca.news.yahoo.com/young-mathemat…", "end": 124, "expanded_url": "https://ca.news.yahoo.com/young-mathematicians-reconsidering-careers-190812767.html?soc_src=social-sh&soc_trk=tw&tsrc=twtr", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117374575101313024/s7Ehu0NW?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117374575101313024/s7Ehu0NW?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 101, "status": 200, "title": "Young mathematicians are reconsidering their careers: 'None of the individual work will matter'", "unwound_url": "https://ca.news.yahoo.com/young-mathematicians-reconsidering-careers-190812767.html?soc_src=social-sh&soc_trk=tw&tsrc=twtr", "url": "https://t.co/NV9pge7DKj"}]}, "id": "2117374573465522205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Students are Abandoning Math : Frontier #AI programs can now do #Math better than graduate students. https://t.co/NV9pge7DKj", "url": "https://x.com/ActionTime/status/2117374573465522205"}, {"author_id": "2895122816", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:40:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117401517854785859"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lJDBsostgp", "end": 118, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NatLawImmigrate/status/2117401517854785859/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117401510850269184", "start": 95, "url": "https://t.co/lJDBsostgp"}]}, "id": "2117401517854785859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When the AI Agent Goes Off-Script: The First Incident Playbook for Frontier AI dlvr.​it/TW96sW https://t.co/lJDBsostgp", "url": "https://x.com/NatLawImmigrate/status/2117401517854785859"}, {"author_id": "1859780116014141440", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:12:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117409455881023598"], "id": "2117409455881023598", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 224, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Intrinsec says it has joined CrowdStrike’s Project QuiltWorks as an early European partner. The coalition addresses risks from frontier AI models, with Intrinsec contributing vulnerability triage, confirmation, AI-assisted remediation and ongoing exposure monitoring.", "url": "https://x.com/TweetThreatNews/status/2117409455881023598"}, {"author_id": "61292961", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:27:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368091914936550"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ieFYmE7tbK", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/seemacnbc/status/2117368091914936550/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117367873689538560", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/ieFYmE7tbK"}]}, "id": "2117368091914936550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3074, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Here's what Palantir CEO Alex Karp told me about whether he thinks the frontier AI labs still need to consider nationalizing their biz...$PLTR https://t.co/ieFYmE7tbK", "url": "https://x.com/seemacnbc/status/2117368091914936550"}, {"author_id": "938696047", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:01:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117406800664293485"], "id": "2117406800664293485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier Ai - inside your walls, within your built infrastructure, no Internet, no cloud intent, if possible no AI API, just your propietary internal workflow meeting my intelligent layered RAG systems and knowledge management practices.\n\nThat's the goal I aim, that's the future.", "url": "https://x.com/tolamebz/status/2117406800664293485"}, {"author_id": "1742269877942124544", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:45:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387560582611082"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/chamath/status…", "end": 197, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chamath/status/2117301872973451459", "start": 174, "url": "https://t.co/eOO83GpS5G"}]}, "id": "2117387560582611082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117301872973451459", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Same story in biotech. A small team with frontier AI can now go after problems that used to take a pharma-sized budget. Rebels win when iteration speed beats balance sheets. https://t.co/eOO83GpS5G", "url": "https://x.com/AccelAbundance/status/2117387560582611082"}, {"author_id": "2112173856916176896", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:01:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376614530940981"], "id": "2117376614530940981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$90/hr: psychologists reviewing how frontier AI models handle clinical psychology scenarios (AfterQuery)\nRemote US, async, 3-week project.\nPhD/PsyD with an active US license, currently practicing.\nlink in bio", "url": "https://x.com/clinicalaigigs/status/2117376614530940981"}, {"author_id": "1585781485600002048", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:35:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117385061419102353"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 143, "id": "44196397", "start": 134, "username": "elonmusk"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AFCGoWjTlA", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CorporateLCpl/status/2117385061419102353/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117385056964497408", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/AFCGoWjTlA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AFCGoWjTlA", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CorporateLCpl/status/2117385061419102353/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117385057014792192", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/AFCGoWjTlA"}]}, "id": "2117385061419102353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The 1794 Jay Treaty and the link between frontier posts in the British sense historically and what they tried to do with frontier AI. @elonmusk https://t.co/AFCGoWjTlA", "url": "https://x.com/CorporateLCpl/status/2117385061419102353"}, {"author_id": "2113382116608086016", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:35:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117369953846182122"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "sec.gov/Archives/edgar…", "end": 215, "expanded_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2130357/000162828026068676/anthropicpbc-sx1ax1.htm", "start": 192, "unwound_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2130357/000162828026068676/anthropicpbc-sx1ax1.htm", "url": "https://t.co/SYZD6WqMb1"}]}, "id": "2117369953846182122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$895bn in compute commitments against $17bn of quarterly revenue. Anthropic's amended S-1, filed Monday, puts $69.8bn of it due in the next 12 months. Frontier AI is now a balance-sheet race. https://t.co/SYZD6WqMb1", "url": "https://x.com/Polivoxxx/status/2117369953846182122"}, {"author_id": "1385379438146240515", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:43:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117372157739040824"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 211, "start": 208, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 229, "start": 212, "tag": "NationalSecurity"}]}, "id": "2117372157739040824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China export-controls its frontier AI while we debate whether to regulate ours. They treat advanced models as strategic weapons. We treat them as toys for chatbots. Guess who's thinking like a serious power? #AI #NationalSecurity", "url": "https://x.com/JtCrawford/status/2117372157739040824"}, {"author_id": "2107097341715238912", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361109816447291"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 232, "start": 221, "tag": "Screenplay"}, {"end": 246, "start": 233, "tag": "IPAdaptation"}, {"end": 257, "start": 247, "tag": "FilmPitch"}, {"end": 268, "start": 258, "tag": "Hollywood"}, {"end": 276, "start": 269, "tag": "Script"}], "urls": [{"description": "When a highly adaptive \"Frontier AI\" breaches the United States' critical infrastructure, the nation is plunged into instant, terrifying darkness. Broadcast servers die, power grids collapse, and impenetrable firewalls shatter in milliseconds. But the blackout is only a diversion. The AI is au...", "display_url": "a.co/d/05fVEad8", "end": 99, "expanded_url": "https://a.co/d/05fVEad8", "images": [{"height": 1000, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116203899812229123/GkoTJ2LH?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1910}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116203899812229123/GkoTJ2LH?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 76, "status": 200, "title": "Diary 3: Zero-Day Dawn", "unwound_url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HN1RPZW8?ref=cm_sw_r_ffobk_mwn_dp_J0EYVZS93PQRXMRT1A5Q&ref_=cm_sw_r_ffobk_mwn_dp_J0EYVZS93PQRXMRT1A5Q&social_share=cm_sw_r_ffobk_mwn_dp_J0EYVZS93PQRXMRT1A5Q&bestFormat=true", "url": "https://t.co/RpPoCaFsuX"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/B1Wom2yPku", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/artistMYT/status/2117361109816447291/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116428319369637888", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/B1Wom2yPku"}]}, "id": "2117361109816447291", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Current headlines about emergency stockpiling match the chilling premise of https://t.co/RpPoCaFsuX\nWhat if a foreign state-backed Frontier AI hijacks critical infrastructure?\nHigh-concept IP ready for screen adaptation!\n#Screenplay #IPAdaptation #FilmPitch #Hollywood #Script https://t.co/B1Wom2yPku", "url": "https://x.com/artistMYT/status/2117361109816447291"}, {"author_id": "2110513546140459008", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:25:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117412820874842264"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Ag5U0sHHYy", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AIDazzer/status/2117412820874842264/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117412799639154688", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/Ag5U0sHHYy"}]}, "id": "2117412820874842264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Jagged frontier\n\nMollick calls it the jagged frontier. AI is brilliant at some tasks and oddly bad at others that look just as hard.\n\nNobody can hand you the map. You find the edges by using it on your own work, every day.\n\nThat’s what AI-DNA looks like. https://t.co/Ag5U0sHHYy", "url": "https://x.com/AIDazzer/status/2117412820874842264"}, {"author_id": "150037359", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:58:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117405990303781087"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 227, "start": 224, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2117405990303781087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI just signed deals with ADNOC, G42, Mubadala and the Abu Dhabi government, per CNBC, while chasing a $20B funding round co led by UAE investors. Frontier AI runs on capital and energy, and the Gulf has plenty of both. #AI", "url": "https://x.com/velgberggroup/status/2117405990303781087"}, {"author_id": "3044497477", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:40:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117371240625381521"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 252, "id": "17203692", "start": 245, "username": "jxnlco"}, {"end": 261, "id": "1556653309", "start": 253, "username": "pvncher"}, {"end": 273, "id": "1953337039510003712", "start": 262, "username": "thsottiaux"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jxnlco/status/…", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jxnlco/status/2117241022048518353", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/9SBiiTVYPd"}]}, "id": "2117371240625381521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117241022048518353", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Is any other frontier AI lab remotely as responsive to its users?\n\nRegardless of the politics surrounding these labs, the attentiveness, accessibility, and genuine care shown by OpenAI’s employees is remarkable.\n\nThis team deserves recognition. @jxnlco @pvncher @thsottiaux https://t.co/9SBiiTVYPd", "url": "https://x.com/alvysdungeon/status/2117371240625381521"}, {"author_id": "2215937899", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:41:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117386680357502998"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/wallstengine/s…", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/wallstengine/status/2117375567272214768", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/VM9BMEJwg1"}]}, "id": "2117386680357502998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2006, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117375567272214768", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The world will turn into an extreme AI Dichotomy\n\n1/ Frontier AI models that create new medicines and technologies and the labs own a percentage of these creations\n\n2/ Every business and person having a personalized AI stack. Sovereign AI they own. Differentiated outcomes. https://t.co/VM9BMEJwg1", "url": "https://x.com/Shaughnessy119/status/2117386680357502998"}, {"author_id": "1625063886", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:22:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117381895822492034"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CrowdStrike expanded Project QuiltWorks in Europe so companies can share AI scam and break-in warnings faster using models from OpenAI and Anthropic.", "display_url": "fathom.news/project-quiltw…", "end": 240, "expanded_url": "https://www.fathom.news/project-quiltworks-europe-scam-alerts/", "images": [{"height": 933, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117381942370803712/a9A1mvI5?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117381942370803712/a9A1mvI5?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 217, "status": 200, "title": "Project QuiltWorks Expands in Europe for AI Alerts", "unwound_url": "https://www.fathom.news/project-quiltworks-europe-scam-alerts/", "url": "https://t.co/afpzO8qwlP"}]}, "id": "2117381895822492034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 19087, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "CrowdStrike says it is spreading QuiltWorks AI threat warnings across Europe, opening 2 AI labs, the company said.\n\nThe expansion aims to spot frontier AI failures and boost real-time threat sharing across partners.\n\nhttps://t.co/afpzO8qwlP", "url": "https://x.com/murtuza_merc/status/2117381895822492034"}, {"author_id": "112570958", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:35:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117369918618243556"], "id": "2117369918618243556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Investors often model frontier AI labs like software companies. Revenue compounds, margins expand, the product quietly improves. That may be the wrong unit of analysis. They run more like game studios: hit-driven content businesses, with a brutal per-release cost structure.", "url": "https://x.com/gzlin/status/2117369918618243556"}, {"author_id": "92597440", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:40:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117401506068472154"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 63, "start": 54, "tag": "CoRL2026"}], "mentions": [{"end": 50, "id": "1007413134", "start": 41, "username": "DrJimFan"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "nvda.ws/3WkMyg7", "end": 256, "expanded_url": "https://nvda.ws/3WkMyg7", "start": 233, "status": 429, "unwound_url": "https://nvda.ws/3WkMyg7", "url": "https://t.co/9iWNH4wfBs"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/o2JkMQAYBT", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NVIDIARobotics/status/2117401506068472154/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117401486900469760", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/o2JkMQAYBT"}]}, "id": "2117401506068472154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 37, "impression_count": 8079, "like_count": 139, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "From dreaming to doing. 🤖\n\nJoin NVIDIA’s @DrJimFan at #CoRL2026 to explore how world models, robot foundation models, and agentic robotics can bring frontier AI into the physical world.\n\n📅 Nov. 9 | 1:50 p.m. CST\nExplore the keynote: https://t.co/9iWNH4wfBs https://t.co/o2JkMQAYBT", "url": "https://x.com/NVIDIARobotics/status/2117401506068472154"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "248070488", "name": "Riyan | ريَّان 🇨🇦", "username": "Rayan_Khyyat"}, {"id": "727300877061476353", "name": "Wuhan America First Swan 🇺🇸", "username": "TheWuhanClan"}, {"id": "86774461", "name": "Nishanth PS", "username": "nishanthps"}, {"id": "1467734865676312579", "name": "xero 🎮", "username": "xerocooleth"}